```\r\n\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import create_engine\r\n\r\ne = create_engine(\r\n    \"mysql+pymysql://scott:tiger@localhost/test?\"\r\n    \"ssl_ca=/path/to/ca&ssl_capath=/path/to/cas&ssl_cipher=tls1&ssl_key=/path_to_key\"\r\n)\r\n\r\nprint(e.dialect.create_connect_args(e.url))\r\n\r\n```\r\nthis assembles the ssl arguments in a dictionary as required by mysqlclient / pymysql / others(?) :\r\n\r\n`[[], {'host': 'localhost', 'db': 'test', 'user': 'scott', 'passwd': 'tiger', 'ssl': {'ca': '/path/to/ca', 'key': '/path_to_key', 'capath': '/path/to/cas', 'cipher': 'tls1'}, 'client_flag': 2}]\r\n`\r\n\r\nhowever there is no mention of \"ssl\" in the docs at https://docs.sqlalchemy.org/en/13/dialects/mysql.html.\r\n\r\nadditonally, it's not clear if an additional parameter \"check_hostname\" needs to be supported.","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5397/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart"